  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **High Hawk Season**: back after 32 archived shows (648 days) [3]\n- **Lovecraft in Brooklyn**: back after 126 archived shows (3451 days) [3]\n- **Waco**: back after 213 archived shows (5452 days); rare: 4 archived performances [3]\n- **The Plague**: back after 229 archived shows (6021 days); rare: 8 archived performances [3]\n- **Cut Off Their Thumbs**: back after 94 archived shows (2351 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n- **In Memory of Satan**: back after 31 archived shows (512 days) [3]\n- **Song for Sasha Banks**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 4 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tmg2018-08-31** (recommended): source not stated; 30 songs; 90 min [1]\n- **mountaingoats2018-08-31.flac16**: source not stated; 21 songs; 90 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Uploader found it one of the most intimate Mountain Goats shows they had attended, with an energetic crowd [1]\n- Al Riggs was the opening act for this leg of the tour [1]\n- Show had a solo section by John, then the full band returned, followed by two separate encores [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mountaingoats2018-08-31.flac16**: taped by ezralite23; transferred by ezralite23; source: Zoom H4N [2]",
